ーに全プログラマーが参加する。"],"choiceMode":"text","correctAnswer":1,"diagramRequired":true,"figures":[{"kind":"official_pdf_crop","file":"fe-2026-7fb3984bb494-q11-p8.png","page":8,"rect":[20,463.7,496,625.7],"zoom":3,"width":1428,"height":486,"sha256":"fa867e09403427d1d86f13fb50a891cade2f729ef2d37850336067057eb4ff6c"}],"questionPdfUrl":"https://www.ipa.go.jp/shiken/mondai-kaiotu/sg_fe/koukai/rcu1hd0000012qj6-att/2026r08_fe_kamoku_a_qs.pdf","answerPdfUrl":"https://www.ipa.go.jp/shiken/mondai-kaiotu/sg_fe/koukai/rcu1hd0000012qj6-att/2026r08_fe_kamoku_a_ans.pdf","questionPdfSha256":"7fb3984bb494cad928232823e224b7e58f3eaef59ea523deaa4bae2085c8fba3","answerPdfSha256":"02976cdb5d2c14ec3c5304a1dc89d1db77ca04f0d62fe78fc4c2448dcf0ea6a7","evidence":{"questionPdfPages":[8],"questionRect":[469.7,619.7],"field":"IPA_FE_OFFICIAL_SECTION","fieldEvidence":null,"notes":[]},"verification":{"questionText":"runtime_pdf_checked","choices":"runtime_pdf_checked","answer":"same_year_official_answer_checked","visual":"official_pdf_crop_rendered","field":"verified"}},{"sourceMode":"runtime_official_pdf","qualificationId":"fe","year":2026,"section":"科目A","questionId":"fe:2026:科目A:12","questionNumber":12,"fieldId":"fe_general","unitId":null,"stem":"バーンダウンチャートの使い方として，適切なものはどれか。","stemMode":"text","choices":["縦軸を完成した成果物の総量，横軸を時間とし，プロジェクトが進むに従って完成した成果物の総量が増加する様子を確認する。","縦軸を残課題の総数，横軸を時間とし，プロジェクトが進むに従って残課題の総量が増減する様子を確認する。","縦軸を残作業の量，横軸を時間とし，プロジェクトが進むに従って残作業の量が減少する様子を確認する。","縦軸を延べ工数，横軸を時間とし，プロジェクトが進むに従って延べ工数が増加する様子を確認する。"],"choiceMode":"text","correctAnswer":3,"diagramRequired":true,"figures":[{"kind":"official_pdf_crop","file":"fe-2026-7fb3984bb494-q12-p9.png","page":9,"rect":[20,63.6,496,265.6],"zoom":3,"width":1428,"height":607,"sha256":"51c8d75ca475585cfca6ed82741e384b7c58edfc0e28c94b99b20397def73b90"}],"questionPdfUrl":"https://www.ipa.go.jp/shiken/mondai-kaiotu/sg_fe/koukai/rcu1hd0000012qj6-att/2026r08_fe_kamoku_a_qs.pdf","answerPdfUrl":"https://www.ipa.go.jp/shiken/mondai-kaiotu/sg_fe/koukai/rcu1hd000001